openvino_bevfusion fixes that g3dbevfusion relies on: detection head weights,
sparse encoder layout, OpenVINO 2026 compatibility and checkpoint sanitizing.

Squashed from https://github.com/openvinotoolkit/openvino_contrib/pull/1197
(head 1d7ca25ae8d53ea510c19b47bb16061b834e2104), against openvino_contrib
master 192fffa4a6533502d1a523e7853f5d982be57dd8. Remove this patch once the
PR is merged and g3dbevfusion_prepare.sh pins a commit that contains it.

